### Crear orden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "MOB-1001",
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "category": "PAYMENT",
  "description": "El pago aparece como pendiente después de varios minutos.",
  "channel": "MOBILE_APP",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Listar todas las órdenes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders

### Filtrar por estado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders?status=OPEN

### Consultar orden por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders/1

### Cambiar OPEN -> IN_PROGRESS
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Cambiar IN_PROGRESS -> RESOLVED
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### Ejemplo de transición inválida
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Ejemplo de creación inválida
POST http://localhost:8080/api/support-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "",
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "category": "PAYMENT",
  "description": "corta",
  "channel": "MOBILE_APP",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}
